#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wire Cutting Phrased as a Two-Qubit `Move` Instruction"
msgstr "Wire Cutting yang Dinyatakan sebagai Arahan `Move` Dua-Qubit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/03_wire_cutting_via_move_instruction.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/03_wire_cutting_via_move_instruction.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, we will reconstruct expectation values of a seven-qubit circuit by splitting it into two four-qubit circuits using wire cutting.\n"
msgstr "Dalam tutorial ini, kita akan membina semula nilai jangkaan bagi satu Circuit tujuh-Qubit dengan memecahkannya kepada dua Circuit empat-Qubit menggunakan wire cutting.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take in this [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah langkah-langkah yang akan kita ikuti dalam [corak Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1: Petakan masalah kepada Circuit dan operator quantum**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Petakan hamiltonian ke dalam satu Circuit quantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2: Optimumkan untuk perkakasan sasaran** [_Menggunakan addon cutting_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Potong Circuit dan observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpile subeksperimen untuk perkakasan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3: Laksanakan pada perkakasan sasaran**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen yang diperoleh dalam Langkah 2 menggunakan primitif `Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4: Pasca-proses keputusan** [_Menggunakan addon cutting_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Gabungkan keputusan Langkah 3 untuk membina semula nilai jangkaan observable yang dikehendaki.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Peta {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to cut {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"
msgstr "Cipta Circuit untuk dipotong {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we begin with a circuit inspired by Fig. 1(a) of [arXiv:2302.03366v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.03366v1).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, kita mulakan dengan Circuit yang diilhamkan oleh Rajah 1(a) daripada [arXiv:2302.03366v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.03366v1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Nyatakan observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new circuit where `Move` instructions have been placed at the desired cut locations {#create-a-new-circuit-where-move-instructions-have-been-placed-at-the-desired-cut-locations}"
msgstr "Cipta Circuit baru di mana arahan `Move` telah diletakkan di lokasi pemotongan yang dikehendaki {#create-a-new-circuit-where-move-instructions-have-been-placed-at-the-desired-cut-locations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Given the above circuit, we would like to place two wire cuts on the middle qubit line, so that the circuit can separate into two circuits of four qubits each.  One way to do this is to manually place two-qubit `Move` instructions that move the state from one qubit wire to another.  A `Move` instruction is conceptually equivalent to a reset operation on the second qubit, followed by a SWAP gate.  The effect of this instruction is to transfer the state of the first (source) qubit to the second (detination) qubit, while discarding the incoming state of the second qubit.  For this to work as intended, it is important that the second (destination) qubit share no entanglement with the remainder of the system; otherwise, the reset operation will cause the state of the remainder of the system to be partially collapsed.\n"
msgstr "Berdasarkan Circuit di atas, kita ingin meletakkan dua wire cut pada garisan qubit tengah, supaya Circuit boleh dipisahkan menjadi dua Circuit yang masing-masing terdiri daripada empat qubit. Salah satu cara untuk melakukan ini ialah dengan meletakkan secara manual arahan `Move` dua-Qubit yang memindahkan keadaan dari satu wayar qubit ke wayar yang lain. Arahan `Move` secara konsepnya setara dengan operasi set semula pada qubit kedua, diikuti oleh gate SWAP. Kesan arahan ini ialah ia memindahkan keadaan qubit pertama (sumber) ke qubit kedua (destinasi), sambil membuang keadaan masuk qubit kedua. Untuk ini berfungsi seperti yang diharapkan, adalah penting bahawa qubit kedua (destinasi) tidak berkongsi sebarang keterjalinann dengan bahagian sistem yang lain; jika tidak, operasi set semula akan menyebabkan keadaan bahagian sistem yang lain runtuh separa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, we build a new circuit with one additional qubit and the `Move` operations in place.  In this example, we are able to reuse a qubit: the source qubit of the first `Move` becomes the destination qubit of the second `Move` operation.\n"
msgstr "Di sini, kita membina Circuit baru dengan satu qubit tambahan dan operasi `Move` di tempatnya. Dalam contoh ini, kita boleh menggunakan semula satu qubit: Qubit sumber bagi `Move` pertama menjadi qubit destinasi bagi operasi `Move` kedua.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: As an alternative to working directly with `Move` instructions, one may choose to mark wire cuts using a single-qubit `CutWire` instruction.  The `cut_wires` function exists to transform `CutWire`s to `Move` instructions on newly allocated qubits.  However, in contrast to the manual method, this automatic method does not allow for the re-use of qubit wires.  See the `CutWire` [how-to guide](../how-tos/how_to_specify_cut_wires.ipynb) for details.\n"
msgstr "Nota: Sebagai alternatif kepada bekerja secara langsung dengan arahan `Move`, seseorang boleh memilih untuk menandakan wire cut menggunakan arahan `CutWire` satu-Qubit. Fungsi `cut_wires` wujud untuk mengubah `CutWire` kepada arahan `Move` pada qubit yang baru diperuntukkan. Walau bagaimanapun, berbeza dengan kaedah manual, kaedah automatik ini tidak membenarkan penggunaan semula wayar qubit. Lihat [panduan cara](../how-tos/how_to_specify_cut_wires.ipynb) `CutWire` untuk butiran lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create observable to go with the new circuit {#create-observable-to-go-with-the-new-circuit}"
msgstr "Cipta observable untuk Circuit baru {#create-observable-to-go-with-the-new-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This observable corresponds with `observable`, but we must account correctly for the extra qubit wire that has been added (i.e., we insert an \"I\" at index 4).  Note that in Qiskit, the string representation qubit-0 corresponds to the right-most Pauli character.\n"
msgstr "Observable ini sepadan dengan `observable`, tetapi kita perlu mengambil kira dengan betul wayar qubit tambahan yang telah ditambah (iaitu, kita memasukkan \"I\" pada indeks 4). Perhatikan bahawa dalam Qiskit, perwakilan rentetan qubit-0 sepadan dengan aksara Pauli paling kanan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate the circuit and observables {#separate-the-circuit-and-observables}"
msgstr "Pisahkan Circuit dan observable {#separate-the-circuit-and-observables}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As in the previous tutorials, qubits sharing a common partition label will be grouped together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition will be cut.\n"
msgstr "Seperti dalam tutorial sebelumnya, qubit yang berkongsi label partition yang sama akan dikumpulkan bersama, dan gate bukan tempatan yang merentasi lebih daripada satu partition akan dipotong.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the decomposed problem {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"
msgstr "Visualisasikan masalah yang telah didekomposisi {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_4.png)\n"
msgstr "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/03-wire-cutting-via-move-instruction/output_4.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Kira overhed pensampelan bagi pemotongan yang dipilih {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two wires, resulting in a sampling overhead of $4^4$.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita memotong dua wayar, menghasilkan overhed pensampelan sebesar $4^4$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang overhed pensampelan yang ditanggung oleh circuit cutting, rujuk [bahan penjelasan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Jana subeksperimen untuk dijalankan pada Backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr "`generate_cutting_experiments` menerima argumen `circuits`/`observables` sebagai kamus yang memetakan label partition qubit kepada `subcircuit`/`subobservables` yang berkaitan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk mensimulasikan nilai jangkaan Circuit bersaiz penuh, banyak subeksperimen dijana daripada taburan kuasikemungkinan bersama gate yang didekomposisi dan kemudiannya dilaksanakan pada satu atau lebih Backend. Bilangan sampel yang diambil daripada taburan dikawal oleh `num_samples`, dan satu pekali gabungan diberikan bagi setiap sampel unik. Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang cara pekali dikira, rujuk [bahan penjelasan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend {#choose-a-backend}"
msgstr "Pilih Backend {#choose-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we are using a fake backend, which will result in Qiskit Runtime running in local mode (i.e., on a local simulator).\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita menggunakan Backend palsu, yang akan menyebabkan Qiskit Runtime berjalan dalam mod tempatan (iaitu, pada simulator tempatan).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Sediakan subeksperimen untuk Backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We must transpile the circuits with our backend as the target before submitting them to Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Kita mesti melakukan Transpile pada Circuit dengan Backend kita sebagai sasaran sebelum menghantarnya ke Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen menggunakan primitif Sampler Qiskit Runtime {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pasca-proses {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Bina semula nilai jangkaan {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "Bina semula nilai jangkaan bagi setiap sebutan observable dan gabungkannya untuk membina semula nilai jangkaan bagi observable asal.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Bandingkan nilai jangkaan yang dibina semula dengan nilai jangkaan tepat daripada Circuit dan observable asal {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

